<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Dina restructures management.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Dina restructures management.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican truck and bus builder Consorcio G Grupo Dina said on Tuesday a management restructure involving the company's national, Latin American, U.S. and Canadian operations.</p>
<p>Dina said in a statement that James P. Bernacchi had been made chief executive operating officer for the United States and Canada, Gamaliel Garcia chief executive operating officer for Mexico and Latin America and Guillermo Kareh Aarun chief executive corporate officer for Mexico, the United States and Canada.</p>
<p>All positions are effective immediately.</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7287902))</p>
